      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: I agree, funnily enough I already made a separate canny post for this a few months ago. I just decided to suggest this as an alternate solution\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/option-for-chatbox-to-render-over-avatar",
